{"id":"90228ad7fbdc5179","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-definable-set.md","title":"Definable Set","display":"df-definable-set — Definable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-definable-set","aliases":["17-df-definable-set"],"display":"df-definable-set — Definable Set","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-formula]]","[[17-df-free-variable]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-assignment]]","[[17-df-satisfaction]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"local parameter-free n-ary specialization/generalization of compared unary definitions","source_verification_history":["not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"],"source_section":"1.4; 4.3","source_result":"Exercise 1.4.17(ii); Exercise 4.3.21, unary parameter definability","source_pages_print":[48,259],"source_pages_djvu":[64,275],"verification_date":"2026-10-13","legacy_label":"17-df-1.6.1"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-definable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-definable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-definable-set — Definable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"local parameter-free n-ary specialization/generalization of compared unary definitions"},{"key":"source_verification_history","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed</span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.4; 4.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Exercise 1.4.17(ii); Exercise 4.3.21, unary parameter definability"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>48</span><span>259</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>64</span><span>275</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_date","html":"2026-10-13"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-1.6.1"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>（语言，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeVar}\\)</span> (free-variable operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> (assignments, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_L\\)</span> (satisfaction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i=v_i\">\\(x_i=v_i\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_n(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_n(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak A|^n)\">\\(\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak A|^n)\\)</span> 的子集，以下定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Def}_n(\\mathfrak{A})\n=\\bigl\\{X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{A}|^n:\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\;&amp;\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|^n\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\bar a\\in X\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\,\n((\\forall i&lt;n\\;s(x_i)=\\bar a(i))\n\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi))\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Def}_n(\\mathfrak{A})\n=\\bigl\\{X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{A}|^n:\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\;&amp;\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|^n\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\bar a\\in X\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\,\n((\\forall i&lt;n\\;s(x_i)=\\bar a(i))\n\\to\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi))\n\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The defining formula has no parameters from the carrier.  The universal\nquantification over assignments is harmless because the displayed free-variable\ncondition makes satisfaction depend only on the coordinates of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\">\\(\\bar a\\)</span>.</p>\n<p>原书 Exercise 4.3.21（印刷 p.259，DjVu275）及 Exercise 1.4.17(ii)（p.48，DjVu64）给出带参数的一元可定义子集。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元、无参数版本是本地推广／特例，数字 1.6.1 不对应原书结果号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时论域是仅含空元组的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^0\">\\(A^0\\)</span>，公式限定为句子，定义仍有意义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-for